# SNMP simulation data for testing
# Format: OID|Type|Value
# Types: 4=STRING, 2=INTEGER, 65=COUNTER32, 66=GAUGE32, 67=TIMETICKS

# SNMPv2-MIB (System group)
# sysDescr is a router's real shape (e2e, #111): 247 characters across four
# CRLF-separated lines, hex-encoded (4x) because the format cannot carry the
# line breaks. reading-rows.spec.ts clips and reveals it.
